      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5b31f5aa1c76e00054b5f2f2",
      "background": "",
      "content": "<p>Our mascot is a Bell frog<br/>\nin the eye of the bole of a tree.<br/>\nAnd each part a ghost. You can tell<br/>\njust by the way their edges dash.</p>\n\n<p>The <aa to=\"102,103,99\">Bell frog</aa> is ringing like a web-<br/>\nsocket—every three seconds—<br/>\n\"be see, be see,\" on it rings. And<br/>\nwe chose their metatarsal hop.</p>\n\n<p>You, trance-ending particle. You<br/>\namphibious service call.</p>",
      "created": "2018-06-26T08:13:30.441Z",
      "fullWidth": false,
      "lovers": [
        "59a38965d9eba100763a0f59",
        "5b31fd271c76e00054b5f2f3"
      ],
      "page": 101,
      "parent": {
        "__v": 0,
        "_id": "5a13c2c6de1f950071ab6547",
        "background": "",
        "content": "Silver Sword<br/>\nHirundo<br/>\nAerundo<br/>\nHurricane Hirundo (swallow)<br/>\nHurricane Aquila (eagle)<br/>\nHurricane Accipter (hawk)<br/>\nThe Impeccable<br/>\nSymmechromatic<br/>\nThunderblender<br/>\nThe Resilient Bullet<br/>\nIntelligent Bullet<br/>\nBullet Cloisoné<br/>\nBullet Lavolta<br/>\nThe Intelligent Whale<br/>\nThe Arc-en-Ciel (the rainbow)<br/>\nArcenciel<br/>\nMongoose Civique<br/>\nAnticipator<br/>\nRegna Racer (couronne a couronne)<br/>\nAeroterre<br/>\nFée Rapide<br/>\nComme Il Faire<br/>\nTonnere Alifère<br/>\n(winged thunder)<br/>\nAliforme Alifère<br/>\n(wing-slender a-wing)<br/>\nTurbotorc<br/>\nThunderbird Allié<br/>\n(Cousin Thunderbird)<br/>\nThunder Crester<br/>\nDearborn Diamanté<br/>\nMagigravure<br/>\nPastelogram<br/>\nRegina-Rex<br/>\nTaper Racer<br/>\nVarsity Stroke<br/>\nAngelastro<br/>\nAstranaut<br/>\nChaparral<br/>\nTir á l'arc (bull's eye)<br/>\nCresta Lark<br/>\nTriskelion (three legs running)<br/>\nPluma Piluma (hairfine, feather-foot)<br/>\nTurcotinga (solid indigo)<br/>\nUtopian Turtletop<br/>",
        "created": "2017-11-21T06:08:06.407Z",
